  "description": "Emails a summary of recent integrator.io flow errors. Three chained flows list the flow steps in the account, collect the errors from the lookback window, and have an AI agent write a summary that is sent through Outlook Mail. The recipient address is set in the Email Error Summary with Outlook preMap script.",
